++/*
++ * Browan MerryIoT Hotspot Miner V1 (board silkscreen BROWAN_H1GW).
++ *
++ * RK3566 with an RK809 PMIC, a TCS4525 CPU rail, eMMC, a TF slot, an RTL8211F
++ * Gigabit PHY on GMAC1, an SDIO Wi-Fi module (AP6212A or AP6236) and a
++ * mini-PCIe style SX1302 LoRa card wired to SPI3. The LoRa card is not a PCIe
++ * device: only its supply, its SPI bus and a few GPIOs reach the SoC.
++ *
++ * Pin numbers, supplies and delays come from the vendor's factory device
++ * tree; where a value could not be confirmed on a unit, the comment next to
++ * it says so.
++ */
++
